  "story": {
    "title": "Ady and the laptop",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Ady watches his dad do something \"tap tap tap!\" \"It is office work, Ady\" he says.",
      "Ady tries to touch the black and red thing. \"It is a laptop, Ady\" dad says. \"I do my work on it.\"",
      "Ady watches as dad works on his laptop \"tap tap tap\"! \"What fun!\" he thinks.",
      "Ady is eager to play with it. \"I want to do the same\" he tries to tell, \"tap tap tap!\" He jumps to touch the laptop.",
      "But mom carries Ady away from the laptop and gives him milk. She sings a lovely song, Ady forgets all about the laptop.",
      "Then dad reads Ady's favorite story book and puts him to bed.",
      "Ady is sleeping with his favorite doggy but he hears \"tap tap tap\" and then he sees the laptop!",
      "Ady is now doing \"tap tap tap\" on the laptop! Just like mom and dad!",
      "\"Ding Dong!\" the bell rings and Ady wakes up from his sleep! Oh it was all a dream!!!",
      "\"I was doing \"tap tap tap\" on a laptop! Just like mom and dad!\" Ady remembers his dream!",
      "Ady walks to his dad and does \"tap tap tap\" on his laptop. \"Look dad, I can work too. I will help you!\" he wants to say.",
      "But dad says \"No Ady! This is not for play!\" He carries Ady away from the laptop and puts him to sleep again.",
      "Ady smiles in his sleep, dreaming of \"tap tap tap\"on the laptop! ~"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Ady watches his dad do something \"tap tap tap!\" \"It is office work, Ady\" he says.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ady nhìn bố làm gì đó \"tách tách tách!\". Bố nói: \"Đây là việc ở văn phòng đó, Ady.\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ady tries to touch the black and red thing.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ady cố chạm vào cái đồ màu đen và đỏ đó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"It is a laptop, Ady\" dad says.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố nói: \"Đây là cái máy tính xách tay đó, Ady.\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I do my work on it.\"",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bố làm việc trên đó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ady watches as dad works on his laptop \"tap tap tap\"!",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ady nhìn bố làm việc trên máy tính \"tách tách tách\"!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"What fun!\" he thinks.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé nghĩ: \"Thật là vui!\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ady is eager to play with it.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ady rất muốn chơi với nó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I want to do the same\" he tries to tell, \"tap tap tap!\" He jumps to touch the laptop.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé cố nói: \"Con cũng muốn làm như vậy, tách tách tách!\". Cậu bé nhảy lên để chạm vào máy tính."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But mom carries Ady away from the laptop and gives him milk.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng mẹ bế Ady ra xa khỏi máy tính và cho cậu bé uống sữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She sings a lovely song, Ady forgets all about the laptop.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ hát một bài hát hay, Ady quên hết cả cái máy tính."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then dad reads Ady's favorite story book and puts him to bed.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau đó, bố đọc cuốn truyện yêu thích của Ady và đưa cậu bé đi ngủ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ady is sleeping with his favorite doggy but he hears \"tap tap tap\" and then he sees the laptop!",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ady đang ngủ cùng chú chó bông yêu thích nhưng cậu bé nghe thấy tiếng \"tách tách tách\" và rồi cậu bé nhìn thấy cái máy tính!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ady is now doing \"tap tap tap\" on the laptop!",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ady bây giờ đang \"tách tách tách\" trên máy tính!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Just like mom and dad!",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Giống hệt bố và mẹ!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Ding Dong!\" the bell rings and Ady wakes up from his sleep!",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Leng keng!\" chuông reo và Ady tỉnh dậy khỏi giấc ngủ!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Oh it was all a dream!!!",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ồ, tất cả chỉ là một giấc mơ!!!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I was doing \"tap tap tap\" on a laptop!",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Con đã 'tách tách tách' trên máy tính!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Just like mom and dad!\" Ady remembers his dream!",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Giống hệt bố và mẹ!\" Ady nhớ lại giấc mơ của mình!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ady walks to his dad and does \"tap tap tap\" on his laptop.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ady đi đến chỗ bố và \"tách tách tách\" trên máy tính của bố."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Look dad, I can work too.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Bố nhìn này, con cũng có thể làm việc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I will help you!\" he wants to say.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con sẽ giúp bố!\" cậu bé muốn nói."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But dad says \"No Ady!",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng bố nói: \"Không được đâu Ady!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "This is not for play!\" He carries Ady away from the laptop and puts him to sleep again.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cái này không phải để chơi!\" Bố bế Ady ra xa khỏi máy tính và đưa cậu bé đi ngủ lần nữa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ady smiles in his sleep, dreaming of \"tap tap tap\"on the laptop! ~",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140376/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ady mỉm cười trong giấc ngủ, mơ về việc \"tách tách tách\" trên máy tính! ~"
      }
    ]
  },
